'''Crazed Yuki''' (狂乱のユキ) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Crazed Yuki
|image = E 408.png
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,222¢ - 8,776¢
}}

==Enemy==
Just like her [[Yuki (Enemy)|original]] and [[Lost World Yuki (Enemy)|lost]] counterpart, she sports high health and range with relatively low damage.  Any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-floating Units]] can deal with her with ease. In later stages she is supported well with enemy meatshields, so long range and [[Wave Attack]] units are able to chip her down. While normally being easy, her stats skyrocket in higher Crown crown stages she is in, making for a truly fearsome enemy.

